<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>numb, deaden</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύνας κωφοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Liqu.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.116
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>: metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πρὸς μάθησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.548
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκωφωμένος πρὸς τὰ τεχνικὰ θεωρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deafen</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁκόσοισιν ἂν τὰ ὦτα κωφωθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.60
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.224
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>put to silence</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <i>become dumb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				38(39).3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>maim, injure</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, cf. Erot.s.v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωφωθῇ</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of water, <i>lose its freshness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
